# check: fail error[E38]: an embed's path is text known while compiling - a literal, or what reads no local
# E38: "embed" binds as a prefix operator: its operand is the whole unary after it, so an index read through an embed
# is parenthesized - here the index is the path's, and a Char is no path
X := embed "e38bound.olang"[0]
fn main() ? { assert X.Len() > 0 }
